{"code":"005965","name":"동부건설우","market":"KOSPI","sector_name":"건설","sector_desc":"주택·토목·플랜트 시공. 부동산 경기, 금리, 해외 수주와 원가율이 핵심 변수입니다.","desc":"동사는 1969년 토목, 건축 및 기계설치 분야를 목표로 설립되어 1978년 상장된 법인임. 지배회사 동부건설은 건설업을 하며, 종속회사로 엔지니어링서비스(동부엔지니어링), 부동산(더파크, 필우산업개발, 와이제이글로벌개발) 등이 있음. 2026년 베트남 법인을 신설해 해외 인프라 시장에 진출하고 있으며, 플랜트사업본부 확대를 통해 첨단산업환경을 발굴하고 있음.","f":{"date":"2026-10-26","n_days":298,"close":15840.0,"open":15840.0,"high":16190.0,"low":15840.0,"volume":93,"amount":1473120.0,"ret_1d":0.0,"gap":0.0,"range_pct":2.2096,"ret_5":-1.4925,"ret_20":-8.4393,"ret_60":-1.5538,"ret_120":-22.3529,"ret_250":-16.1905,"ma20":16594.5,"ma60":16924.8333,"ma120":17179.75,"ma200":18287.3,"close_vs_ma200":-13.3825,"close_vs_ma60":-6.4097,"ma_align":0,"cross_ma200_20d":0.0,"slope_60":-12.1556,"r2_60":0.0657,"slope_120":-18.1154,"r2_120":0.1888,"slope_250":-16.884,"r2_250":0.1464,"high52":57000.0,"low52":12150.0,"pos_52w":8.2274,"dd_52w":-72.2105,"mdd_1y":-65.5809,"atr14_pct":2.4892,"vol_ann_60":27.6175,"vol_avg20":398.55,"vol_ratio20":0.2333,"vr5":1.3762,"vr20":0.1814,"amount_avg5":9090430.0,"amount_avg20":6459585.5,"amount_avg60":7145178.8333,"obv_chg20":-27.324,"turnover_20":3.5312,"pv_eff_20":-2.3899,"rsi14":35.5047,"frgn_net_5":13.0,"inst_net_5":-10.0,"frgn_net_5_pct":0.0058,"inst_net_5_pct":-0.0044,"smart_net_5_pct":0.0013,"frgn_net_20":-440.0,"inst_net_20":2.0,"frgn_net_20_pct":-0.1949,"inst_net_20_pct":0.0009,"smart_net_20_pct":-0.194,"frgn_net_60":-512.0,"inst_net_60":23.0,"frgn_net_60_pct":-0.2268,"inst_net_60_pct":0.0102,"smart_net_60_pct":-0.2166,"frgn_net_120":-513.0,"inst_net_120":242.0,"frgn_net_120_pct":-0.2273,"inst_net_120_pct":0.1072,"smart_net_120_pct":-0.1201,"foreign_ratio":18.55,"foreign_ratio_chg_60":-0.25,"smart_buy_streak":0,"op_income_q":180.0,"op_margin_q":3.0196,"op_qoq":78.2178,"op_turnaround":0.0,"op_yoy":1025.0,"rev_yoy":44.2643,"op_trend_4q":27.1349,"fin_period":"202606","roe":15.09,"debt_ratio":205.01,"per":4.58,"pbr":0.62,"div_yield":2.21,"foreign_rate":18.55,"t